/answ - TryMe answer command
/answer - TryMe answer command
/tryme - basic command
/tryme add [category] [questionname] - Add new question
/tryme amode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - All game modes
/tryme bmode (-c BCat) (-r RCat) - Block brake game mode
/tryme cmode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - Custom game mode
/tryme delete [category] [questionName] - Delete existing question
/tryme dmode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - Decode game mode
/tryme edit [category] [questionName] - Edit existing question
/tryme emode (-c ECat) (-r RCat) - Eat task game mode
/tryme fmode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - Flash game mode
/tryme hmode (-c HCat) (-r RCat) - HangMan game mode
/tryme holocreate [gamemode] [answers/average/besttime] [ASC/DESC] [lineCount] - Create hologram for top list. CMI plugin required
/tryme holoupdate [gamemode] - Update holograms manually by game mode
/tryme info - Shows currently running game information (for admins)
/tryme kmode (-c KCat) (-r RCat) - Entity kill task game mode
/tryme mmode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - Math game mode
/tryme next - Gives next question/string/code
/tryme pmode (-c PCat) (-r RCat) - Block place task game mode
/tryme qmode (-c QCat) (-r RCat) - Question game mode
/tryme reload - Reload config and locale file
/tryme signupdate [gamemode] - Update signs manually by game mode
/tryme startsc - Start scheduler
/tryme stats (playername) - Show players stats
/tryme stop - Stops all game modes
/tryme stopsc - Stop scheduler
/tryme toggle (playerName) - Toggle question visibility
/tryme top [gamemode] (-f answers/besttime/average) (-o asc/desc) - Get top list of players
